UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am not sure what happens if East passes. I open 1@C and West overcalls 1N. Then I suspect partner passes and they end up in 2@S, because East will transfer to spades. So it probably would have worked out better for East-West if East did not open 2@S.|
PG| ***** 49 ***** |


