^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It makes no difference. |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| applies pretty much regardless of your strength. It is either a good contact or a good sacrifice. It is especially good at favorable vulnerability.|
