nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|We play 2 over 1 game forcing at this table. 1NT by an unpassed hand is always forcing. Some 2/1 pairs play that 1N by a passed hand is not forcing. However, I prefer to still play it as forcing, as this deal illustrates. East has a 3-card limit raise and intends to bid 3@S over whatever response West makes to 1N forcing.|
